{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Charlotte": 13,
    "Lynette": 6,
    "Lyney": 7,
    "Paimon": 9,
    "Player": 1
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "1400301",
      "subQuestName": "Wait till the next morning (08:00 – 12:00)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "140030101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "140030101": {
            "id": "140030101",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "I'm very sorry, Charlotte, but my sister and I are quite busy today. I'm afraid we will have to decline this interview...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030102"
            ]
          },
          "140030102": {
            "id": "140030102",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Oh, please, Lyney? I'll only take a moment of your time! If you would be so kind!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030103"
            ]
          },
          "140030103": {
            "id": "140030103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. What's happening here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030104"
            ]
          },
          "140030104": {
            "id": "140030104",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "I spent all night writing my piece about The Phantom Weasel, and it was going to go to print this morning...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030105"
            ]
          },
          "140030105": {
            "id": "140030105",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "But just as dawn broke, I suddenly received news that Cesar's fiancée, Jemma, had contacted the Gardes and confessed to having been the real Phantom Weasel all along!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030106"
            ]
          },
          "140030106": {
            "id": "140030106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That was quick!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030107"
            ]
          },
          "140030107": {
            "id": "140030107",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Ahem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030108"
            ]
          },
          "140030108": {
            "id": "140030108",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030109"
            ]
          },
          "140030109": {
            "id": "140030109",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Too late, bro.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030110"
            ]
          },
          "140030110": {
            "id": "140030110",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Hohoho! \"That was quick,\" you say? It sounds like I've got some catching up to do! Please, fill me in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030111"
            ]
          },
          "140030111": {
            "id": "140030111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, whoops!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030112"
            ]
          },
          "140030112": {
            "id": "140030112",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Aha! My instincts did not lead me astray — you DO have something to hide! Jemma turning herself in must have something to do with Lyney's performance last night!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030113"
            ]
          },
          "140030113": {
            "id": "140030113",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Maybe watching my high-altitude escape trick reminded her of a better time with Cesar, and she could no longer ignore the voice of her conscience.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030114"
            ]
          },
          "140030114": {
            "id": "140030114",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Huh, okay then... Wait, no no no, there must be more to it! If that's all it took for her to have a change of heart, how did it take her ten whole years?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030115"
            ]
          },
          "140030115": {
            "id": "140030115",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Umm... Well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030116"
            ]
          },
          "140030116": {
            "id": "140030116",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Charlotte's journalistic spirit is burning red — we're going to have to distract her somehow...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030117"
            ]
          },
          "140030117": {
            "id": "140030117",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Ah, I remember now! You and Jemma were nowhere to be found after the show... What happened between you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030118"
            ]
          },
          "140030118": {
            "id": "140030118",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Quickfire question! Where did you all go after the show?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030119"
            ]
          },
          "140030119": {
            "id": "140030119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, we went to the cemetery, and Lyney did a private magic trick, just for us!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030120"
            ]
          },
          "140030120": {
            "id": "140030120",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Actually, glad you mentioned it, 'cause that reminds Paimon. Guess what? Lyney's started using Rainbow Roses in his tricks!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030121"
            ]
          },
          "140030121": {
            "id": "140030121",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "*cough*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030122"
            ]
          },
          "140030122": {
            "id": "140030122",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "...What?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030123"
            ]
          },
          "140030123": {
            "id": "140030123",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "I don't recall ever having received a Rainbow Rose from you myself. Is this supposed to mean that they're more important to you than your own sister?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030124"
            ]
          },
          "140030124": {
            "id": "140030124",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "No! I, I just, uh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030125"
            ]
          },
          "140030125": {
            "id": "140030125",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#What the... What now? Oh, did Paimon say something wrong again, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030126"
            ]
          },
          "140030126": {
            "id": "140030126",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#This is getting pretty awkward... What do we do, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030127"
            ]
          },
          "140030127": {
            "id": "140030127",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "*sigh* Seems like this interview wasn't meant to be. Well, never mind — there's always next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030128"
            ]
          },
          "140030128": {
            "id": "140030128",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Forgive my persistence, but when there's explosive news waiting to be found, I can't turn away! The news about Jemma has already made waves, and I'll stop at nothing to get to the bottom of it all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030129"
            ]
          },
          "140030129": {
            "id": "140030129",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Apparently, one of the things she said to the Gardes was that her \"final wish is to see Lorenzo one last time.\" *sigh* There's clearly a web of complicated relationships there... Can't blame me for being curious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030130"
            ]
          },
          "140030130": {
            "id": "140030130",
            "speakerId": 1070,
            "speakerName": "Charlotte",
            "text": "Alright, I guess I'll leave you to continue the rest of your conversation in peace. Bye for now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030131"
            ]
          },
          "140030131": {
            "id": "140030131",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, Lynette, Paimon didn't mean to—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030132"
            ]
          },
          "140030132": {
            "id": "140030132",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Don't worry, I wasn't angry. I was just trying to distract her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030133"
            ]
          },
          "140030133": {
            "id": "140030133",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, really? Thank goodness. You scared Paimon there!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030134"
            ]
          },
          "140030134": {
            "id": "140030134",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Phew, you and me both, Paimon, you and me both... At least it did the job, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030135"
            ]
          },
          "140030135": {
            "id": "140030135",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "...Please take good care of that Rainbow Rose.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140030136"
            ]
          },
          "140030136": {
            "id": "140030136",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "I'd be really upset if you lost it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
